  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#writing-suggestions\n>6.8.6 Writing suggestions\n>User agents offer writing suggestions as users type into editable regions, either in form controls (e.g., the textarea element) or in elements in an editing host.\n\n\nWhich of the following is the nuance of the above sentence?\n- User agents **MUST** offer writing suggestions as......\n- User agents **SHOULD** offer writing suggestions as......\n- User agents are **RECOMMENDED** to offer writing suggestions as......\n- User agents **MAY** support writing suggestions as......\n- User agents **can** support writing suggestions as......\n- Some user agents are offering writing suggestions as......",
